        {"id": "cud-chewing", "title": {"en": "Ruminating while standing", "de": "Wiederkäuen im Stehen"}, "description": {"en": "The standing cow chews the cud at one jaw cycle per second (Beauchemin 1991) with a slight nod of the head, a flick of the near ear and a slow swish of the tail; nasal breathing at 24 breaths per minute.", "de": "Die stehende Kuh käut mit einem Kieferzyklus pro Sekunde wieder (Beauchemin 1991), nickt leicht mit dem Kopf, schlägt einmal mit dem nahen Ohr und wedelt langsam mit dem Schwanz; Nasenatmung mit 24 Atemzügen pro Minute."}, "durationS": 5, "fps": 30, "loop": true, "rootMotion": "none", "keys": [{"t": 0, "pose": "standing-chewing", "ease": "smooth", "bones": {"jaw": {"angleDeg": -3}, "head": {"angleDeg": 2.0}, "tail-1": {"angleDeg": 0.0}, "tail-2": {"angleDeg": -1.2}, "ear-n": {"angleDeg": 6}}}, {"t": 0.4, "pose": "standing-chewing", "ease": "smooth", "bones": {"jaw": {"angleDeg": -13}, "head": {"angleDeg": 3.27}, "tail-1": {"angleDeg": 5.8}, "tail-2": {"angleDeg": 2.4}, "ear-n": {"angleDeg": 6}}}, {"t": 0.8, "pose": "standing-chewing", "ease": "smooth", "bones": {"jaw": {"angleDeg": -5}, "head": {"angleDeg": 3.36}, "tail-1": {"angleDeg": 10.1}, "tail-2": {"angleDeg": 6.4}, "ear-n": {"angleDeg": 6}}}, {"t": 1, "pose": "standing-chewing", "ease": "smooth", "bones": {"jaw": {"angleDeg": -3}, "head": {"angleDeg": 2.88}, "tail-1": {"angleDeg": 11.4}, "tail-2": {"angleDeg": 8.2}, "ear-n": {"angleDeg": 6}}}, {"t": 1.4, "pose": "standing-chewing", "ease": "smooth", "bones": {"jaw": {"angleDeg": -13}, "head": {"angleDeg": 1.45}, "tail-1": {"angleDeg": 11.8}, "tail-2": {"angleDeg": 11.0}, "ear-n": {"angleDeg": 6}}}, {"t": 1.8, "pose": "standing-chewing", "ease": "smooth", "bones": {"jaw": {"angleDeg": -5}, "head": {"angleDeg": 0.53}, "tail-1": {"angleDeg": 9.2}, "tail-2": {"angleDeg": 12.0}, "ear-n": {"angleDeg": 6}}}, {"t": 2, "pose": "standing-chewing", "ease": "smooth", "bones": {"jaw": {"angleDeg": -3}, "head": {"angleDeg": 0.57}, "tail