        {"id": "lie-down", "title": {"en": "Lying down", "de": "Abliegen"}, "description": {"en": "Non-looping transition after Krohn and Munksgaard (1993): the standing cow lowers its head and sniffs the floor, folds both fore legs and kneels on the carpi, then flexes the hind legs and sinks the haunches until the sternum, hocks and hooves rest on the ground, the far fore leg stretching forward. Contact spans overlap so the cow is supported at every instant.", "de": "Nicht wiederholter Übergang nach Krohn und Munksgaard (1993): die stehende Kuh senkt den Kopf und beschnuppert den Boden, schlägt beide Vorderbeine ein und kniet auf den Vorderfußwurzeln, beugt dann die Hinterbeine und lässt die Hinterhand absinken, bis Brustbein, Sprunggelenke und Klauen auf dem Boden ruhen, das ferne Vorderbein streckt sich nach vorn. Die Kontaktspannen überlappen, sodass die Kuh in jedem Augenblick gestützt ist."}, "durationS": 11, "fps": 30, "loop": false, "rootMotion": "none", "keys": [{"t": 0, "pose": "standing-chewing", "ease": "smooth"}, {"t": 1.5, "pose": "standing-chewing", "ease": "smooth", "bones": {"neck": {"angleDeg": -28}, "head": {"angleDeg": 22}, "jaw": {"angleDeg": -6}, "ear-n": {"angleDeg": 14}}}, {"t": 3.6, "pose": "kneeling-front", "ease": "smooth"}, {"t": 6.4, "pose": "lowering-hindquarters", "ease": "smooth"}, {"t": 7.6, "pose": "lying-resting", "ease": "smooth", "bones": {"scapula-ff": {"angleDeg": 0}, "humerus-ff": {"angleDeg": 50.3}, "forearm-ff": {"angleDeg": 90.1}, "cannon-ff": {"angleDeg": -67.5}, "hoof-ff": {"angleDeg": -27.0}}}, {"t": 9.0, "pose": "lying-resting", "ease": "smooth"}, {"t": 11, "pose": "lying-resting", "ease": "smooth", "bones": {"jaw": {"angleDeg": -10}}}], "contacts": [{"anchor": "contact-hn", "fromS": 0, "toS": 11}, {"anchor": "contact-hf", "fromS": 0, "toS": 11}, {"anchor": "contact-fn", "fromS": 0, "toS": 3.8}, {"anchor": "contact-ff", "fromS": 0, "toS": 3.8}, {"anchor": "contact-ff", "fromS": 8.6, "toS": 11}, {"anchor": "contact-carpu